# P25Gateway leg clone patch (see GATEWAY-PATCHES.md). R=required O=optional E=ensure
# Expected values are from the node's LIVE P25Gateway.ini (Nov 13 2026).
# Pairing rule: gateway RptPort == leg MB [P25 Network] LocalPort (33011);
# gateway LocalPort == leg MB [P25 Network] GatewayPort (33010). (The
# stock main chain pairs these off-by-one -- 32010 vs 32011 -- which
# may be why main-chain P25/NXDN gateway traffic has never flowed.)
R|General|RptPort|32010|33011
R|General|LocalPort|42020|33010
R|Log|FilePath|*|/var/log/mmdvm
R|Log|FileRoot|*|P25Gateway-XP25
R|Network|Port|42010|42410
O|Remote Commands|Port|6074|6174
E|Network|Startup|
